  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prep. meeting Indigenous</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samer&#xE5;det/ICC f&#xF6;rberedand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samer&#xE5;det och Inuit Circumpolar Conference (ICC) ordnar ett  f&#xF6;rberedande m&#xF6;te f&#xF6;r 30 representanter f&#xF6;r ursprungsbefolkningar i tredje v&#xE4;rlden. Sverige delfinansierar detta f&#xF6;rberedande m&#xF6;te till-sammans med Danmark. Konsultationerna skall vara en dialog mellan ursprungsbefolkningsrepresentanter och EU-kommissionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Saami Council and Inuit Circumpolar Conference take the initiativeto host a two day preparatory meeting for the indigenous representati-ves before the consultation in Brussels. The consultation is a dialogubetween indigenous representatives and the commission to establish a basic inter-cultural understanding</narrative>
  </description>
